      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Neuro-Demoplas was compared in a double blind trial on behalf of its analgesic properties to another antiphologistic containing high dosage of vitamin B complex and Metamizol. The onset of action of Neuro-Demoplas to inhibit pain was clearly more rapid, more intensive and more durable than with the other antiphlogistic."},
